<mxfile host="65bd71144e">
    <diagram name="System Design" id="system-design">
        <mxGraphModel dx="2505" dy="673" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1500" pageHeight="1400" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="2" value="Design a Search Autocomplete / Typeahead System" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="620" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="3" value="FRs -&amp;gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Suggest relevant completions for a prefix string&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Return top 5 suggestions ranked by popularity&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Add new phrases when encountered from user search queries&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Out Of Scope -&amp;gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Fuzzy matching (minor spelling mistakes)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;NFRs -&amp;gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Highly available (99.9% ~ 8.6 hrs downtime/year)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Low latency suggestions (p99 &amp;lt; 100ms)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Eventual consistency acceptable for popularity&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. 10M DAU, 5 searches/day, ~50 calls/search&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; -&amp;gt; ~50k QPS avg, ~500k QPS peak (10x)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Freshness: phrase searchable &amp;lt; 5 min after&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; crossing the popularity threshold&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="80" width="570" height="300" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="4" value="Core Entities -&amp;gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Phrase (text, popularity_count, createdAt, updatedAt)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Suggestion { phraseText, score }&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;APIs&amp;nbsp; (userId from JWT, verified at API Gateway) -&amp;gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. GET /suggestions?prefix={}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; -&amp;gt; 200 { suggestions: [ {phraseText, score} ] }&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; READ-ONLY, cacheable. Top 5 by popularity.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Fired per keystroke (debounced, prefix &amp;ge; 2 chars).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. POST /searches&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Body: { phraseText }&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Records a committed search: upsert phrase +&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; increment popularity_count. Fired once on enter /&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; suggestion click. Idempotency-Key header to&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; dedupe client retries.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="620" y="80" width="470" height="300" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="rl" value="READ PATH&#10;(~500k QPS peak, p99 &lt; 100ms)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1f6feb;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="430" width="320" height="36" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="6" value="Client&#10;(keystroke)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="490" width="130" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="20" value="CDN /&#10;Edge Cache" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="280" y="490" width="130" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="5" value="API Gateway&#10;(JWT auth,&#10;rate limiting)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="520" y="490" width="130" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="21" value="Query Router&#10;(holds partition map:&#10;prefix -&gt; shard)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="760" y="485" width="160" height="90" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="22" value="Shard&#10;Load Balancer&#10;(across replicas)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1030" y="490" width="150" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="8" value="Suggestion Service&#10;(stateless query layer)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1280" y="490" width="170" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="23" value="Follower Trie Replicas&#10;(read-only IMMUTABLE snapshot per shard;&#10;in-memory prefix trie, each node caches top-5)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1230" y="660" width="270" height="100" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="wl" value="WRITE / INGESTION PATH&#10;(~50k QPS, one event per committed search)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#b85c00;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="850" width="420" height="36" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="24" value="Client&#10;(presses enter /&#10;clicks suggestion)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="910" width="150" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="25" value="Write / Ingestion&#10;Service" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="320" y="910" width="160" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="26" value="Popularity Counter Store&#10;(phrase -&gt; count)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="600" y="910" width="190" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="27" value="Leader Trie&#10;(per shard, writable)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="910" y="910" width="160" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="28" value="WAL&#10;(replication log)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1190" y="910" width="150" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e30" value="GET /suggestions?prefix=&#10;(per keystroke, debounced, prefix &#8805; 2 chars)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="6" target="20">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e31" value="cache miss" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="20" target="5">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e32" value="authenticated&#10;request" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="5" target="21">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e33" value="route by 2-char&#10;prefix -&gt; shard" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="21" target="22">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e34" value="forward to a&#10;healthy replica" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="22" target="8">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e35" value="prefix lookup -&gt;&#10;return cached top-5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="8" target="23">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e36" value="POST /searches { phraseText }&#10;(auth via API Gateway)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="24" target="25">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e37" value="upsert phrase +&#10;increment count" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="25" target="26">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e38" value="apply delta; update&#10;node top-5 heaps" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="26" target="27">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e39" value="append change&#10;to log" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="27" target="28">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e40" value="replicate -&gt; periodic rebuild -&gt;&#10;atomic root-pointer swap (&#8804; 5 min)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="28" target="23">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e41" value="response: top-5 suggestions (p99 &lt; 100ms)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#1f6feb;fontColor=#1f6feb;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="8" target="6">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="50" value="DESIGN NOTES&#10;&#10;Data structure: in-memory prefix trie; EACH NODE caches its top-5 phrases (min-heap of size 5) so a read is O(prefix length) - navigate to the node, return the cached list, no subtree scan.&#10;&#10;Sharding: partition by the first 2 chars of the prefix (~676 partitions). An entire subtree stays on one shard so traversal is local. A hot shard (e.g. 'ne') is split deeper to 3 chars; the Query Router holds the partition map. Only autocomplete once prefix &#8805; 2 chars (product decision -&gt; avoids cross-shard fan-out for short prefixes).&#10;&#10;Concurrency: followers serve an IMMUTABLE trie snapshot. Updates arrive via WAL; a follower rebuilds a fresh trie off to the side, then atomically swaps the root pointer -&gt; readers never see a torn trie. Rebuild interval &#8804; 5 min satisfies the freshness NFR.&#10;&#10;Abuse: the popularity threshold IS the spam filter - a phrase becomes suggestible only after enough committed searches; no separate garbage classifier needed for the basic case.&#10;&#10;Sizing: ~1B phrases x ~100 bytes = ~100 GB raw text; trie overhead (child pointers + per-node heap) pushes it to several hundred GB -&gt; does not fit one box -&gt; must shard." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="1060" width="1100" height="290" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="legend" value="LEGEND&#10;&#10;Blue  = client / edge&#10;Green = stateless services&#10;Orange = trie storage&#10;Red = replication log&#10;&#10;Solid arrow = request flow&#10;Blue dashed = read response&#10;Red dashed = async replication" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1170" y="1060" width="280" height="290" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
</mxfile>
